 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 3.6,
   "end": 5.85,
   "text": "Jordan has experience helping patients."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.2,
   "end": 9.19,
   "text": "But the next move isn't just another front-desk job."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.801,
   "end": 12.811,
   "text": "Jordan wants to help run a practice."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.621,
   "end": 18.391,
   "text": "So the search starts with a clear direction, and the kind of work that would actually fit."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.543,
   "end": 24.173,
   "text": "This role looks promising."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.683,
   "end": 28.093,
   "text": "The pay and direction make sense."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.503,
   "end": 32.233,
   "text": "But there's a catch: Jordan hasn't confirmed the Epic experience the employer requires."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.718,
   "end": 44.454,
   "text": "Instead of guessing, Jordan checks the record: scheduling, referrals,"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.504,
   "end": 47.608,
   "text": "insurance work, and a problem solved at the clinic."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.158,
   "end": 50.808,
   "text": "Real experience, with limits worth knowing."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.806,
   "end": 58.436,
   "text": "With those facts, Sojourner prepares a resume for this opportunity."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.966,
   "end": 61.976,
   "text": "Its truth check helps keep unverified experience out."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.386,
   "end": 65.576,
   "text": "Jordan can put a stronger application together without making things up."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.548,
   "end": 71.478,
   "text": "The decision stays Jordan's."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.728,
   "end": 74.598,
   "text": "Sojourner keeps the opportunity, the resume, and the next step in one place."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.068,
   "end": 77.558,
   "text": "It doesn't apply to employers on Jordan's behalf."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.472,
   "end": 86.362,
   "text": "A clearer direction. An honest assessment."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.852,
   "end": 89.322,
   "text": "And one next step that Jordan chose deliberately."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.78,
   "end": 94.4,
   "text": "Sojourner. Make the next move count."
  }
 ]
}